  "body": "Bumps [docs-resources](https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources) from `ab24eec` to `8b88469`.\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/commit/8b88469fdd351a2318a546c93bd62608dd97dd60\"><code>8b88469</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/riscv/docs-resources/issues/105\">#105</a> from riscv/104-improve-documentation-and-tests-on-tag...</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/commit/26453aa73e36fac0e766923b93c413b57856543a\"><code>26453aa</code></a> Improve test cases and doc for norm rules</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/commit/07ae7bec8d8881726d316cbd8d464ab6eda270fb\"><code>07ae7be</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/riscv/docs-resources/issues/103\">#103</a> from riscv/102-tags-backend-raises-error-node_text_co...</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/commit/fcd51897a623b78cc4ad533678bf1b699245aa81\"><code>fcd5189</code></a> Fix for issue <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/riscv/docs-resources/issues/102\">#102</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/commit/4b6af802d0800a39cc9c44d5c2a50aa238250b0f\"><code>4b6af80</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/riscv/docs-resources/issues/101\">#101</a> from riscv/100-inline-anchors-for-list-table-items</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/commit/e9f5494421122b9dea75534b8c20decd8a94411a\"><code>e9f5494</code></a> Update normative rule documentation to match improvements in tagging made by ...</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/commit/992c7a13db87530358867cad6881a35c7313595c\"><code>992c7a1</code></a> Update test.adoc to use inline anchors.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/commit/14a3283ac4f78ce72938b1323423bfab08ece0b6\"><code>14a3283</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.